      "plugin": {
        "name": "dsh-worktree-space",
        "title": {
          "en": "Worktree Space",
          "zh": "Worktree Space"
        },
        "description": {
          "en": "Worktree Space: one task, one space — work on parallel tracks. Put a task that spans one or more Git repositories into its own task space: every repository involved gets a worktree on the same task branch, and the task space registers itself as a workspace where agent sessions work on their own. Multiple tasks move forward in parallel without interfering with one another; when the work is done, merge back into each repository's target branch and clean up the worktree branches and task spaces as needed. Report problems at https://github.com/kangtsang/dsh-worktree-space/issues",
          "zh": "Worktree Space：一任务一空间，工作多路并行。把一个或多个 Git 仓库的工作任务放进独立任务空间：每个参与的仓库在同一个任务分支上各开一个 worktree，任务空间自动注册为工作区，agent 会话就在其中独立工作。多个任务并行推进、互不干扰；结束后合并回各仓库目标分支，worktree 分支和任务空间按需清理。遇到问题请在 https://github.com/kangtsang/dsh-worktree-space/issues 反馈。"
        },
